@startuml 使用案例3_2: 申請審核作業
title 使用案例3.2: 申請審核作業

actor "送養者\n( 一般會員或收容所會員 )" as User
participant "ApplicationReview.vue" as ApplicationReviewPage
participant "applications.ts" as ApplicationAPI
participant "applications.py(blueprint)" as ApplicationBlueprint
participant "application_service.py" as ApplicationService
participant "permission_service.py" as PermissionService
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "application.py(model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
database "MySQL" as DB

note over User, DB
  **前置條件:**
  使用者在「3.1 申請列表瀏覽」作業中選擇特定申請
  使用者已登入且有審核權限
end note

== 1. 進入申請管理頁面並載入申請列表 ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 訪問 /application-review
activate ApplicationReviewPage
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: onMounted()\\n載入申請列表
note right
  參考使用案例 3.1 流程
  mode='review' (審核模式)
end note
ApplicationReviewPage --> User: 顯示申請列表
deactivate ApplicationReviewPage

== 2. 選擇要更新狀態的申請 ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 點選特定申請卡片
activate ApplicationReviewPage
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: 取得申請詳細資訊
ApplicationReviewPage --> User: 顯示申請詳情
deactivate ApplicationReviewPage

== 3. 開啟審核 Modal ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 點擊「通過」或「拒絕」按鈕
activate ApplicationReviewPage
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: openReviewModal(application, action)
note right
  action: 'approve' 或 'reject'
  只有兩個選項，不是通用狀態管理
end note
ApplicationReviewPage --> User: 顯示審核 Modal
deactivate ApplicationReviewPage

== 4. 填寫審核原因 ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 填寫審核原因/備註
activate ApplicationReviewPage
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: reviewNotes = notes
note right
  通過: 填寫通過原因或注意事項
  拒絕: 填寫拒絕原因 (建議填寫)
end note

== 5. 提交審核 ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 點擊「確認通過」或「確認拒絕」
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: validateForm()
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationAPI: reviewApplication(application_id, {action, review_notes, version})
activate ApplicationAPI
note right
  使用樂觀鎖:
  - version: 當前版本號
  - 防止並發修改衝突
  
  action: 'approve' 或 'reject'
end note
ApplicationAPI -> ApplicationBlueprint: POST /applications/{id}/review
activate ApplicationBlueprint

ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
ApplicationBlueprint -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: 使用者資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationBlueprint: current_user 物件
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationBlueprint: 取得請求資料\\naction, review_notes, version

ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationService: review_application(application_id, current_user, action, review_notes, version)
activate ApplicationService

== 6. 權限檢查 ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(application_id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications WHERE application_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationModel: application 資料
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationModel

alt 申請不存在
  ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: NotFoundError('申請不存在')
  ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 404 Not Found
  ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 錯誤訊息
  ApplicationReviewPage --> User: alert('申請不存在')
  note right: 終止流程
end

ApplicationService -> PermissionService: can_update_application(current_user, application)
activate PermissionService
PermissionService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.get(application.animal_id)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal 資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> PermissionService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查審核權限
note right
  權限規則:
  1. 管理員**不能**審核申請
  2. 動物擁有者可以審核
  3. 收容所會員可以審核所屬動物申請
  4. 申請人本人不能審核自己的申請
end note

alt 無權限
  PermissionService --> ApplicationService: False
  ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: PermissionDeniedError
  ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 403 Forbidden
  ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 錯誤訊息
  ApplicationReviewPage --> User: alert('無權限更新此申請')
  note right: 終止流程
end
PermissionService --> ApplicationService: True
deactivate PermissionService

== 7. 樂觀鎖檢查 ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 檢查 version
alt version 不匹配
  ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ValidationError('申請已被其他人修改')
  ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 409 Conflict
  ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 錯誤訊息
  ApplicationReviewPage --> User: alert('申請已被修改，請重新載入')
  note right: 終止流程
end

== 8. 狀態驗證與更新 ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: old_status = application.status
ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 驗證申請狀態
note right
  檢查申請是否可審核:
  - PENDING → 可審核
  - UNDER_REVIEW → 可審核
  - APPROVED/REJECTED → 不可再審核
  
  注意: 不檢查狀態轉換規則
  approve/reject 直接跳到最終狀態
end note

alt 狀態不可審核 (已通過或已拒絕)
  ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: ValidationError('此申請無法審核')
  ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 400 Bad Request
  ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 錯誤訊息
  ApplicationReviewPage --> User: alert('此申請無法審核')
  note right: 終止流程
end

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: 更新申請狀態
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: UPDATE applications SET\\nstatus=?,\\nreview_notes=?,\\nreviewed_at=NOW(),\\nassignee_id=?,\\nversion=version+1\\nWHERE application_id=?
activate DB
note right
  狀態直接設定:
  - approve → APPROVED
  - reject → REJECTED
  
  記錄審核資訊:
  - review_notes: 審核原因
  - assignee_id: 審核者 ID
  - reviewed_at: 審核時間
  - version: 版本號 +1
end note
DB --> ApplicationModel: 更新成功
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 完成
deactivate ApplicationModel

alt action == 'approve' (核准)
  ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: 更新動物狀態為 ADOPTED
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='ADOPTED', updated_at=NOW()
  activate DB
  note right
    核准申請時自動將動物標記為已領養
    該動物不再顯示在公開清單
  end note
  DB --> AnimalModel: 完成
  deactivate DB
  AnimalModel --> ApplicationService: 完成
  deactivate AnimalModel
end

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: db.session.commit()
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationModel: 提交成功
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 完成
deactivate ApplicationModel

== 9. 記錄審計日誌 ==
ApplicationService -> AuditService: log_application_review(application_id, user_id, old_status, new_status)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\\n(entity_type, entity_id, user_id, action,\\nold_value, new_value, created_at)\\nVALUES ('application', ?, ?, 'review', ?, ?, NOW())
activate DB
note right
  記錄審核歷程:
  - 操作者: reviewer.user_id
  - 舊狀態 → 新狀態
  - 操作時間
  
  註: 審核原因存在 applications 表的 review_notes
end note
DB --> AuditService: 記錄成功
deactivate DB
AuditService --> ApplicationService: 完成
deactivate AuditService

== 10. 發送審核結果通知 ==
ApplicationService -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(application, reviewer_id, status, review_notes)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 建立通知記錄
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\\n(user_id, type, title, content, data, ...)\\nVALUES (applicant_id, 'application_reviewed', ...)
activate DB
note right
  通知申請人審核結果:
  - type: application_reviewed
  - 包含審核狀態 (APPROVED/REJECTED)
  - 包含審核原因
  - 包含送養者聯絡資訊 (如核准)
end note
DB --> NotificationModel: notification_id
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: Notification 物件
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 發送 Email (透過 Celery)
note right
  send_application_notification_email_task.delay(
    to_email=applicant.email,
    animal_name=animal.name,
    status='approved' or 'rejected',
    review_notes=notes,
    contact_info={送養者聯絡資訊}
  )
  
  Email 包含:
  - 審核結果
  - 審核原因
  - 送養者聯絡方式 (如核准)
end note
NotificationService --> ApplicationService: 通知已發送
deactivate NotificationService

ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationService

ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 200 OK + {message, application}
deactivate ApplicationBlueprint
ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 更新成功
deactivate ApplicationAPI

ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 200 OK + {message, application}
deactivate ApplicationBlueprint
ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: 審核成功
deactivate ApplicationAPI

ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: closeReviewModal()
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: fetchApplications() (重新載入列表)
ApplicationReviewPage --> User: alert('✅ 申請已通過' 或 '❌ 申請已拒絕')
deactivate ApplicationReviewPage

note over User, DB
  **後置條件 (使用案例 3.2 - 申請審核作業):**
  1. 申請狀態已更新為 APPROVED 或 REJECTED
  2. 版本號已遞增 (version +1)
  3. 審計日誌已記錄
  4. 系統通知已發送給申請人
  5. Email 已透過 Celery 非同步發送
  6. 如核准: 動物狀態已改為 ADOPTED
  7. 申請列表已重新載入
  
  **權限規則:**
  - 管理員**不能**審核申請 (管理員負責系統管理,不參與審核流程)
  - 動物擁有者可以審核該動物的申請
  - 收容所會員可以審核所屬收容所動物的申請
  - 申請人本人不能審核自己的申請
  
  **審核操作:**
  - approve (核准): 狀態變更為 APPROVED,動物變更為 ADOPTED
  - reject (拒絕): 狀態變更為 REJECTED,動物保持 PUBLISHED
  
  **樂觀鎖機制:**
  - 使用 version 欄位防止並發修改
  - 每次更新 version +1
  - 更新時檢查 expected_version
  - 版本不匹配返回 409 Conflict
  
  **審計追蹤:**
  - 所有審核記錄在 audit_logs
  - 包含操作者、時間、舊狀態、新狀態
  - 審核原因存在 applications.review_notes
  
  **通知機制:**
  - 系統內通知 (Notification 表)
  - Email 通知 (Celery 非同步)
  - 核准時包含送養者聯絡資訊
end note

@enduml
